     *   Calculate: $g_y = \frac{V_{next} - V_{prev}}{2 \Delta y}$ [S29, book].
 4.  **Compute Z-component ($g_z$):**
-    *   Determine neighbors $V_{prev}$ at $(i, j, k-1)$ and $V_{next}$ at $(i, j, k+1)$.
