 ## Background
-The method originates from standard numerical analysis techniques for approximating derivatives. In volume rendering, it was popularized by Levoy for computing surface normals for Phong shading and depth cueing [S2, unofficial]. It is widely used in libraries such as VTK [S29, book] and CGAL [S32] for isosurfacing and local illumination.
